     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "[Followup from Sourceforge Tracker]",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Followup Submitter: sjw46",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Logged In: YES ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "user_id=1709161",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Originator: YES",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Normally, API-M methods that do object modification will result in a new audit",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "record in the object.  This is true for all component (datastream and",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "disseminator) methods, but in the case of the following methods, the logMessage",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "is not recorded anywhere:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "ingestObject",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         },
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "modifyObject",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         },
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "purgeObject",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         }
        ],
        "type": "bulletList"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Note that for purgeObject, it makes no sense to put the audit record in the",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "object.  Something else needs to be done, like writing it to the system log.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
