     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "[Followup from Sourceforge Tracker]",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Followup Submitter: bbranan",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Logged In: YES ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "user_id=1987639",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Originator: NO",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Fixed bug in tasks 145707 (trunk) and 145936 (maintenance-2.2), ingestObject and modifyObject now create audit records which include the provided log message. The log message for purgeObject is written to the server log. In order to allow the choice to create an audit record on object ingest or not, an audit record will only be created if a log message is provided. If no log message is provided on the call, no audit record is created.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Audit records are now created for all API-M methods which update the object with the exception of addRelationship and purgeRelationship. Some discussion will be necessary to determine if providing audit records on these methods is appropriate.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "All API-M methods in 3.0 now log a completion notice at the INFO level which includes any provided log message (this is only done for purgeObject in 2.2.)",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
